sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor B as Borrower
  participant M as al-mobile
  participant AI as al-ai
  participant ECB as ECB data
  B->>M: enter income, debts, deposit
  M->>AI: POST /ai/affordability (Firebase ID token)
  AI->>ECB: benchmark mortgage rate (cached for a day)
  ECB-->>AI: rate and observation date
  AI-->>M: max loan, max price, repayments, rate and date
  B->>M: enter house details and asking price
  M->>AI: POST /ai/valuation (Firebase ID token)
  AI-->>M: estimate, gap, price needs review, breakdown by feature
  Note over M,AI: No application exists yet.<br/>Nothing is stored unless the borrower saves the check.
